# Uforge

Read `doc/architecture.md` before changing structure, services, or data flow.

- Features: `doc/features/<name>.md`
- Technos: `doc/techno/<name>.md`
- Gateway prompt skills (end users, not this agent): `skills/prompt/`

JSDoc and code comments in English with an `@example`. Product `doc/` is in French.

Do not call AI providers from `services/web`. All generation goes through `services/gateway`.

Stack: Docker Compose, NestJS gateway, Prisma/Postgres, Redis, MinIO, Vue 3 + Vite, Capacitor later. Guest apps are sandboxed JS + `runtime.*` bridge, not React Native UI.
